{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：09:41 2026-07-22 HKT</p>\n<p>今日（22日）早上8時21分，觀塘偉業街163號一酒店的一名男住客，被發現在房間內燒炭自殺，昏迷不醒；職員報警求助。救護員到場，將54歲姓徐男事主送往聯合醫院搶救，惜終告不治。警方正調查事件。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b1f4494db7919479f3f2e85e2ae323eb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_10_19_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/13d145a24c01122eed50ba18e015c06b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_10_19_02.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場是偉業街163號一酒店。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/106edaff261145a3c7cfea322455be2b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_10_19_00_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/79ebe44ac4aa9d6ad93bd55b9ba4be87/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_10_19_01_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b90e6f6be6f348d8646f18aab385b568/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_10_19_01.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0cc6a412e7fc39fa6e61586c5818c6cc/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-22_at_10_19_03_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T07:23:06.275138+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}